    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 400\u00b0F.",
      "ingredients": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Add broccoli and chickpeas to a baking sheet, and toss with olive oil, paprika, garlic powder, parsley, salt, and pepper. Roast until chickpeas are crispy and broccoli is tender, about 20 minutes.",
